Marinetti Open Source Project

Release Notes

The files in this CVS repository have been released by Richard Bennett as
Open Source. The structure of the CVS repository does not match the
structure of the source code as Richard released it.
Rather, the structure of the CVS repository has been developed to hold the
source code in a way that is more descriptive and clear for the developer.
This decision was made so that it would not be necessary to move released
files and directories around inside the CVS repository as the project
evolves.

The source files in the CVS repository have been taken from Richard's
original release packages and have been changed to reflect the new
directory structure.

Andrew Roughan - 13 March 2002




 